<!--
  Favourite, saved: the same heart, filled.

  A second state rather than a tint of the first one. The row tints every glyph
  white when it is idle and dark when it is focused, so a colour on the artwork
  cannot carry "you have already saved this" - the fill has to. It is the one
  thing on this row that says the press did something, which is why the shape
  changes and not just the shade.
-->
